    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: S8 (CE-2159 X-d) - a Squad (Leader + Rifleman 1-6, immortal, at (126-150,65)) marches east on test-town toward (300,100) with DangerAreas on, no enemy, and meets the north-south road (x 190-210). Shows the crossing drill: security watches, pairs cross, far side watches, security crosses last, reform. Judge: (1) the crossing drill starts; (2) security is set first, then crossers go; (3) never more than 2 men inside the road strip; (4) the far side is set before security leaves; (5) everyone crosses, the back-half security last; (6) the squad reforms beyond the road and the march resumes; (7) nobody fires; (8) crossing takes <= 120 s. Fail: More than a pair on the road at once, security leaves first, or anyone fires. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch ua-squad-danger-crossing"
  },
